Package: market-sync
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.qtsvg, python3-requests, libnotify-bin, libxcb-cursor0
Recommends: pkexec | policykit-1
Maintainer: mahabubaabir <mahabubaabir@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mahabubaabir/market-sync
Description: Market countdown + economic news in your system tray
 Market Sync shows a live open/close countdown for London, New York,
 Sydney, Tokyo and NYSE, market-local clocks, and the next economic events
 from the ForexFactory calendar.
 .
 Material-glass v0.2 design: 2-column landmark market cards (London Eye,
 Statue of Liberty, Sydney Opera House, Torii Gate), signed countdowns,
 neon-green active sessions, collapsible Up Next news drawer with
 multi-select impact chips and colored currency pills.
 .
 It lives in the system tray (Cinnamon/MATE/Xfce/GNOME), can start silently
 at login, supports one-click self-updates from GitHub releases, and ships
 six themes (system, light, dark, dark purple, mint light, mint dark).
Installed-Size: 512
